import ../../site/games/farm/controller.dl
import site_fixture.dl

to [finish a Farm rebuilding fixture with] {string:output} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set index to the website program for source "Farm source"
    set reply to a JSON object containing [JSON number "status" is 0, JSON number "artifact" is 41, JSON number "milliseconds" is 1]
    receive website compilation reply for index in state
    free reply
    set (state's programs + index)'s output to output
    set reply to a JSON object containing [JSON number "milliseconds" is 1]
    receive website execution reply for index in state
    free reply

set instance to an instance of website fixture
set driver to a website shader test driver
set view to a new UI view
set view's driver to the address of driver
set view's instance to the address of instance
set state to a new website state
set state's services to the browser UI service provider
set state's view to the address of view
set state's route to "/index.html"
set instance's state to (the address of state) as a pointer
prepare website fixture editors in (the address of state)
initialize the website Farm in (the address of state)
set session to the address of (state's farm)
set session's document to the initial website farm document
set document to session's document
set role to the item at 0 in (document's roles)
set actor to the item at 0 in (document's world's workers)
set applied to the string form of "loop 3 times:\n    turn right"
set protocol to the string form of "DYNLEX|TRACE|2|0|2|13|-1\nLOOP|3\nDYNLEX|TRACE|3|4|3|14|-1\nDO|1|3|-1|-2|\nEND"
set plan to the website farm plan from protocol dropping 2 source lines
apply website farm plan plan from applied to role for actor in (document's world)
advance the website farm world (document's world) using roles (document's roles) with workers running true
set actor's paused to true
set document's world's tick to 37
set role's needs rebuilding to true
set role's source to "# A newer draft 🌽\nturn left"
set second to a copy of website farm role role identified by (the string form of "porter") among (document's roles)
set second's applied to applied + "\n# Another saved role"
set second's source to "# Another visible draft"
show website Farm role (role's id) in (the address of state)
run website program 0 in (the address of state)
set other to state's programs + 0
ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm") in (the address of state)
set index to the website program for source "Farm source"
set program to state's programs + index
require condition ((session's rebuilding = false) and ((program's phase = 0) and (other's phase = 1))) reporting "Opening Farm interrupted an existing compilation"
set reply to a JSON object containing [JSON number "status" is 0, JSON number "artifact" is 17, JSON number "milliseconds" is 1]
receive website compilation reply for 0 in (the address of state)
free reply
prepare website Farm saved roles in (the address of state)
require condition (session's rebuilding and (program's source = applied)) reporting "Opening saved Farm roles did not compile their applied snapshot"
require condition ((the value of "Farm preparation notices" in (the address of instance)) = 0) reporting "Saved-role preparation did not show its notice"
require condition ((the value of "Farm preparation retry" in (the address of instance)) = -1) reporting "Running preparation exposed an unnecessary retry control"
require condition ((the UI element (the control labeled "One turn" in (the address of instance)) is enabled in (the address of instance)) = false) reporting "Saved instructions could run before their source migration finished"

# Editing or switching a visible draft must not cancel another applied snapshot.
set the text of "Farm source" in (the address of instance) to "# Editing during preparation 🌽\nturn left"
notice website Farm source edit (the address of instance)
require condition ((program's phase = 1) and (program's source = applied)) reporting "Editing a draft cancelled its independent applied-source compilation"
set the value of "Farm role" in (the address of instance) to 1
set instance's event target to the control labeled "Farm role" in (the address of instance)
notice website Farm field (the address of instance)
require condition ((program's phase = 1) and (document's role id = second's id)) reporting "Choosing another role cancelled saved-role preparation"
finish a Farm rebuilding fixture with protocol in (the address of state)
require condition ((role's needs rebuilding = false) and (session's rebuilding and (session's pending role = second's id))) reporting "Saved roles were not rebuilt sequentially"
require condition (program's source = second's applied) reporting "Preparing another role compiled the visible draft instead of its applied source"
finish a Farm rebuilding fixture with protocol in (the address of state)
require condition ((session's rebuilding = false) and (second's needs rebuilding = false)) reporting "The saved-role queue did not finish"
require condition ((the value of "Farm preparation notices" in (the address of instance)) = -1) reporting "Ready roles retained an empty preparation panel"
require condition ((document's world's tick = 37) and ((actor's routine's position = 2) and ((the item at 0 in (actor's routine's loops)) = 3))) reporting "Rebuilding restarted the world or its saved loop frame"
require condition ((actor's paused) and ((actor's direction = 1) and (actor's routine's traced = false))) reporting "Rebuilding reset worker controls or retained obsolete source ranges"
require condition ((role's source = "# Editing during preparation 🌽\nturn left") and (role's applied = applied)) reporting "Rebuilding replaced a newer role draft"
set editor to the UI source editor labeled "Farm source" in (state's language)
require condition ((the UI main source of editor in (state's language) at 0.0 seconds) = second's source) reporting "Rebuilding replaced the visible role's source"
require condition ((session's playing = false) and (session's clock request = 0)) reporting "Updating saved source started the simulation without an action"

# Failures keep the old plan inert and expose an explicit retry, not stale execution.
set role's needs rebuilding to true
ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm-retry-roles") in (the address of state)
set reply to a JSON object containing [JSON number "status" is 0, JSON number "artifact" is 41, JSON number "milliseconds" is 1]
receive website compilation reply for index in (the address of state)
free reply
set reply to a JSON object containing [JSON number "invocation" is (program's invocation)]
receive website execution start reply in (the address of state)
free reply
receive website execution deadline (program's invocation) in (the address of state)
require condition ((session's rebuild failed) and ((program's phase = 0) and (role's needs rebuilding))) reporting "An unbounded saved role escaped its budget or replaced the saved routine"
ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm-retry-roles") in (the address of state)
set reply to a JSON object containing [JSON number "status" is 1, JSON number "milliseconds" is 1, JSON child "diagnostics" is (a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON text "file" is "/workspace/farm.dl", JSON number "line" is 3, JSON number "column" is 1, JSON text "message" is "Fixture compiler failure"]])]
receive website compilation reply for index in (the address of state)
free reply
require condition ((session's rebuild failed) and ((program's phase = 0) and (role's needs rebuilding))) reporting "A failed saved-role compilation was retried or accepted silently"
require condition ((the UI value for (the control labeled "Farm preparation status" in (the address of instance)) in (the address of instance))'s text = "An error occurred. Check the log.") reporting "A saved-role failure exposed internal details to the page"
require condition (the UI element (the control labeled "Retry saved roles" in (the address of instance)) is enabled in (the address of instance)) reporting "A failed saved-role compilation has no retry"
require condition ((the value of "Farm preparation retry" in (the address of instance)) = 0) reporting "A failed saved-role compilation hid its retry control"
ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm-retry-roles") in (the address of state)
finish a Farm rebuilding fixture with (the string form of "LOOP|4\nDO|1|3|-1|-2|\nEND") in (the address of state)
require condition (session's rebuild failed and ((the item at 0 in (role's program's code))'s count = 3)) reporting "A changed compiled control flow replaced the saved routine"
ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm-retry-roles") in (the address of state)
finish a Farm rebuilding fixture with protocol in (the address of state)
require condition (((session's rebuild failed = false) and (role's needs rebuilding = false)) and (actor's routine's position = 2)) reporting "Retry failed to preserve and recover saved execution state"
require condition (the UI element (the control labeled "One turn" in (the address of instance)) is enabled in (the address of instance)) reporting "Successful preparation left playback unavailable"

ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm-play") in (the address of state)
require condition (session's playing and (session's clock request != 0)) reporting "Ready saved roles could not start the clock"
set role's needs rebuilding to true
ignore follow website Farm action (the string form of "action:farm-retry-roles") in (the address of state)
require condition (session's clock request = 0) reporting "The worker clock continued while saved instructions were rebuilding"
leave website Farm in (the address of state)
require condition (((session's rebuilding = false) and (program's phase = 0)) and (role's needs rebuilding)) reporting "Leaving Farm retained a background rebuild or accepted an unfinished plan"
prepare website Farm saved roles in (the address of state)
require condition (program's phase = 0) reporting "A cancelled rebuild restarted without an explicit retry or reopening"
require condition (other's phase = 2) reporting "Saved-role updates stopped an independently running sketch"
close website Farm in (the address of state)
stop website program 0 in (the address of state)
free website farm plan the address of plan
set pending to state's requests
loop while pending != (0 as a pointer to website request):
    set next to pending's next
    deallocate pending
    set pending to next
release website fixture editors in (the address of state)
close the address of instance
print line "Saved Farm roles rebuild applied snapshots without changing drafts, worker positions or loop frames; failures retry explicitly and leaving cancels work."
